{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "Proposed scoped completed-attempt API objectives; opt-in paging, explicit unknown data and rolling coverage.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Existing route latency diagnostics",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/testlookup-overview-v1"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Proposed objectives — adoption and measurement limits",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Proposals:** 99.9% availability and 95% within each eligible route's latency budget over 30 days. Paging stays disabled until one scoped owner adopts the policy. Select one exact installation/environment/cluster/namespace; empty cluster and namespace select only unlabeled Compose scope.\n\nThis measures **completed eligible API attempts**, excluding ordinary 4xx, health/metrics/admin/export routes and in-flight requests without a terminal observation. **No data is unknown; quiet traffic is not 100% success.** The baseline profile does not load these rules. Full 30-day history and retention are required for a budget. The slow windows evaluate every five minutes; inspect the as-of age. [Adoption and response runbook](https://github.com/test-intelligence/testlookup/blob/main/docs/operations/api-objectives.md)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Current measurement validity",
      "description": "1 requires the complete good/bad pair and a healthy scrape on every currently observed configured API target. Vanished discovery and censored requests still require independent monitoring.",
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Unknown / no eligible traffic",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "last"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "testlookup:api_sli_valid{installation=\"$installation\",environment=\"$environment\",cluster=\"$cluster\",namespace=\"$namespace\",objective=\"$objective\"}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Observed success — 30d as of evaluation",
      "description": "Unknown during warmup, gaps, missing data or no eligible traffic. Never substituted with zero or 100%.",
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "noValue": "Unknown / no eligible traffic",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "last"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "(1 - testlookup:api_sli_error_ratio{installation=\"$installation\",environment=\"$environment\",cluster=\"$cluster\",namespace=\"$namespace\",objective=\"$objective\",window=\"30d\"}) and on (installation,environment,cluster,namespace,objective) testlookup:api_sli_window_complete{installation=\"$installation\",environment=\"$environment\",cluster=\"$cluster\",namespace=\"$namespace\",objective=\"$objective\",window=\"30d\"} and on (installation,environment,cluster,namespace,objective) testlookup:api_sli_window_complete{installation=\"$installation\",environment=\"$environment\",cluster=\"$cluster\",namespace=\"$namespace\",objective=\"$objective\",window=\"5m\"}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Remaining proposed error budget — 30d",
      "description": "1 is all budget remaining; 0 exhausted; negative values are debt. This is the proposed objective until accepted by the site owner.",
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "noValue": "Unknown / no eligible traffic",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "last"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "testlookup:api_sli_remaining_error_budget_ratio{installation=\"$installation\",environment=\"$environment\",cluster=\"$cluster\",namespace=\"$namespace\",objective=\"$objective\"}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Budget evaluation age",
      "description": "The 3d/30d raw-counter queries run every five minutes. A stale or incomplete window is unknown.",
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "Unknown / no eligible traffic",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "last"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "(time() - testlookup:api_sli_budget_observed_at_seconds{installation=\"$installation\",environment=\"$environment\",cluster=\"$cluster\",namespace=\"$namespace\",objective=\"$objective\"}) and on (installation,environment,cluster,namespace,objective) testlookup:api_sli_window_complete{installation=\"$installation\",environment=\"$environment\",cluster=\"$cluster\",namespace=\"$namespace\",objective=\"$objective\",window=\"30d\"} and on (installation,environment,cluster,namespace,objective) testlookup:api_sli_window_complete{installation=\"$installation\",environment=\"$environment\",cluster=\"$cluster\",namespace=\"$namespace\",objective=\"$objective\",window=\"5m\"}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Burn rate by complete window",
      "description": "Proposed page pairs: 1h+5m above 14.4x or 6h+30m above 6x; both require at least three estimated short-window bad attempts. A 3d+6h warning above 1x becomes a ticket only when the receiver implements that routing.",
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Unknown",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "testlookup:api_sli_burn_rate{installation=\"$installation\",environment=\"$environment\",cluster=\"$cluster\",namespace=\"$namespace\",objective=\"$objective\"} and on (installation,environment,cluster,namespace,objective,window) testlookup:api_sli_window_complete{installation=\"$installation\",environment=\"$environment\",cluster=\"$cluster\",namespace=\"$namespace\",objective=\"$objective\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{window}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Observed complete-window coverage",
      "description": "1 means all required observations are retained; lower values mean warmup or gaps. Thirty-day coverage uses complete five-minute checkpoints, each validated against every minute including its baseline. Coverage alone does not prove eligible traffic.",
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "noValue": "Unknown",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "testlookup:api_sli_window_coverage{installation=\"$installation\",environment=\"$environment\",cluster=\"$cluster\",namespace=\"$namespace\",objective=\"$objective\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{window}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Eligible attempts — estimated counter increase",
      "description": "Reset-aware increases are summed across API replicas before division. Each line is a different time window; do not sum the lines.",
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Unknown",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "testlookup:api_sli_eligible_events{installation=\"$installation\",environment=\"$environment\",cluster=\"$cluster\",namespace=\"$namespace\",objective=\"$objective\",window=~\"5m|1h|6h\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{window}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Bad attempts — estimated counter increase",
      "description": "Availability bad includes 429/5xx/unhandled failures. Latency bad also includes successful eligible responses whose final-body duration exceeded the route budget.",
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Unknown",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "testlookup:api_sli_bad_events{installation=\"$installation\",environment=\"$environment\",cluster=\"$cluster\",namespace=\"$namespace\",objective=\"$objective\",window=~\"5m|30m|6h\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{window}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Active adopted owner (empty means paging is not adopted)",
      "description": "Exactly one active owner is required for the selected scope. The checked-in example is inert. Ambiguous policies disable objective pages.",
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Not adopted"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "testlookup:api_objective_active{installation=\"$installation\",environment=\"$environment\",cluster=\"$cluster\",namespace=\"$namespace\",objective=\"$objective\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
